#: ../../architecture.md:48 f720c35681ab4ad1b9c144c808144f89
msgid "**The event loop is single threaded, and that is load-bearing.** Everything that touches the supervisor runs on it, which is what lets `sessions_` and `workers_` be mutated from six entry points with no mutex (`gateway.hpp:18-20`). The supervisor has no thread and no timer of its own — the gateway arms the grace timers and reports every terminal frame back — so \"who is on which thread\" has one answer rather than six."
msgstr "**事件迴圈是單執行緒的，而這件事撐著整個設計。** 每一件碰到監督者的事都跑在它上面，這才使得 `sessions_` 與 `workers_` 可以從六個進入點被修改而不需要任何互斥鎖（`gateway.hpp:18-20`）。監督者沒有自己的執行緒，也沒有自己的計時器——寬限計時器由閘道啟動，每一個終結訊框也由閘道回報——所以「誰跑在哪條執行緒上」只有一個答案，而不是六個。"

#: ../../architecture.md:55 a678a9c19ae44cebbaf59c33b28ee755
msgid "**One session is one thread for its whole life.** Every QuantLib singleton is session-local and none is declared global, so a build without `QL_ENABLE_SESSIONS` gives two concurrent requests one process-wide `Settings::evaluationDate()` and two silently wrong prices. With it, `Singleton<T>::instance()` is `thread_local` (`ql/patterns/singleton.hpp:92`), and a graph built on one thread must never be priced on another. `Worker` constructs its `Session` *inside* `run()` for that reason, never on the caller's thread (`worker.hpp:29-35`)."
msgstr "**一個工作階段一輩子綁在一條執行緒上。** QuantLib 的每一個單例都是工作階段區域的，沒有一個宣告為全域，所以沒有開 `QL_ENABLE_SESSIONS` 的建置會讓兩個並行請求共用同一個行程層級的 `Settings::evaluationDate()`，得到兩個安靜地錯掉的價格。開了之後，`Singleton<T>::instance()` 是 `thread_local`（`ql/patterns/singleton.hpp:92`），而在某條執行緒上建起來的物件圖，絕不能在另一條上定價。`Worker` 正是為此在 `run()` *裡面*建構它的 `Session`，絕不在呼叫端的執行緒上建（`worker.hpp:29-35`）。"

#: ../../architecture.md:64 1013646d98d0420baf24b79873316f15
msgid "**Within a session, everything serializes.** Not merely writes: `NPV()` writes to the lazy cache as it computes, so two nominally read-only prices on one graph cannot overlap. Concurrency comes from more sessions, never from more threads inside one. A hundred-strike smile is a hundred sessions or a loop — which is why the compare panel opens a second session rather than fanning out on the one in front of you."
msgstr "**在一個工作階段裡，一切都是序列化的。** 不只是寫入：`NPV()` 在計算過程中就會寫進惰性快取，所以同一份物件圖上兩個名義上唯讀的定價也不能重疊。並行度來自更多的工作階段，絕不來自一個工作階段裡更多的執行緒。一條含一百個履約價的微笑曲線，就是一百個工作階段或一個迴圈——這也是為什麼比較面板會另開第二個工作階段，而不是在你眼前這個上面散開。"

#: ../../architecture.md:71 4fbe7f72fb2949dd8dcd27a453996fce
msgid "**Placement is a property of the request.** A session opens in a shared worker (eight seats by default) and moves to a sacrificial single-session process when it asks for something long and cancellable. Moving is a close and a replay, not a migration, because the graph is thread-bound. That is the whole reason a `SessionLog` exists: `OpenSession` plus the accepted `UpdateMarket` frames determine the graph completely, so a session that loses its worker is rebuilt under the same `session_id` and the client is never told it moved. What a seat and a worker actually are in this build is the next section."
msgstr "**安置是請求的屬性，不是工作階段的屬性。** 工作階段一開始開在共用的工作者裡（預設八個座位），當它要求某件長而且可取消的工作時，才搬到可犧牲的單一工作階段行程去。搬家是關閉再重播，不是遷移，因為物件圖綁在執行緒上。這就是 `SessionLog` 存在的全部理由：`OpenSession` 加上被接受的那些 `UpdateMarket` 完全決定了物件圖，所以失去工作者的工作階段會以同一個 `session_id` 重建，而用戶端從來不會被告知它搬過家。在這個建置裡，一個座位和一個工作者實際上是什麼，就是下一節的內容。"

#: ../../architecture.md:80 f8a91a6ded6140c390dd658de972e7b8
msgid "**Every rejection names a field.** `QLS_FIELD_REQUIRE` and `QLS_FIELD_FAIL` (`src/errors/fielderror.hpp:66,77`) raise an error carrying a wire code and the dotted path of the field to blame; `session.cpp` uses them 204 times. That path is what the interface highlights, and it is why nothing this build cannot price is silently ignored — the schema is deliberately wider than the build, and the gap between them is answered rather than approximated."
msgstr "**每一次拒絕都指名一個欄位。** `QLS_FIELD_REQUIRE` 與 `QLS_FIELD_FAIL`（`src/errors/fielderror.hpp:66,77`）拋出的錯誤帶著一個線上錯誤碼，以及該負責的欄位的點分路徑；`session.cpp` 用了它們 204 次。介面高亮的就是那條路徑，這也是為什麼這個版本定不出來的東西不會被默默忽略——綱要刻意比建置寬，而兩者之間的落差是被回答，而不是被近似。"

#: ../../architecture.md:87 6f08dfd2b82d46ee8ba010c76e5c9ef9
msgid "Threads and processes"
msgstr "執行緒與行程"

#: ../../architecture.md:89 62bf1a417b244cd1a5ca5a4bf5e500b7
msgid "The layer table says a worker is one thread and one session. This is what that adds up to at runtime, and it is worth having straight before reading either repository, because the vocabulary of the design and the shape of this build are not the same thing: `DESIGN.md` §2.1 is written for worker processes, and this build has none."
msgstr "上面那張分層表說，一個工作者就是一條執行緒、一個工作階段。這一節講的是這件事在執行期加總起來會是什麼樣子；在讀任何一邊的原始碼之前先弄清楚是值得的，因為設計的用語和這個建置的形狀並不是同一回事：`DESIGN.md` §2.1 是為工作者行程寫的，而這個建置一個都沒有。"

#: ../../architecture.md:95 a3ed89ccca7741b2a76a381a88e73c88
msgid "**One process, and it never makes another.** There is no `fork`, `exec*`, `posix_spawn`, `popen` or Boost.Process anywhere in `src/`. `main.cpp` builds a `Gateway` and calls `run()`, which enters `app.run()` on the main thread (`gateway.cpp:663`) and stays there. Everything §2.1 calls a worker process is an entry in a `std::map` here: `ThreadProcessHost::spawn` invents an id, records a placement, and starts nothing at all (`threadhost.cpp:31-35`)."
msgstr "**只有一個行程，而且它從不另開一個。** `src/` 裡任何地方都沒有 `fork`、`exec*`、`posix_spawn`、`popen` 或 Boost.Process。`main.cpp` 建一個 `Gateway` 再呼叫 `run()`，進到主執行緒上的 `app.run()`（`gateway.cpp:663`）之後就停在那裡。§2.1 稱為工作者行程的一切，在這裡都只是一個 `std::map` 裡的項目：`ThreadProcessHost::spawn` 生一個 id、記下安置方式，什麼都沒啟動（`threadhost.cpp:31-35`）。"

#: ../../architecture.md:102 5cedd73bcfcc452a99fcc6d17c25081a
msgid "**Threads are created per session and never pooled.**"
msgstr "**執行緒是按工作階段建立的，從不做池化。**"

