#: ../../architecture.md:110 a4c43408b546492f8d96401c3f49a745
msgid "Those are the only two `std::thread` in the service. There is no pool, and no queue of work for threads to be drawn against: no `std::async`, no TBB, OpenMP forced off (`CMakeLists.txt:50`), and uSockets compiled without its `libuv.c` and `gcd.c` backends (`CMakeLists.txt:195-196`), so the transport has no helper threads of its own either. The live count is one, plus the open sessions, plus whatever abandoned calculations are still running."
msgstr "整個服務裡只有這兩處 `std::thread`。沒有執行緒池，也沒有一個讓執行緒去取用的工作佇列：沒有 `std::async`、沒有 TBB，OpenMP 被強制關掉（`CMakeLists.txt:50`），uSockets 也是在排除 `libuv.c` 與 `gcd.c` 這兩個事件後端的情況下編譯的（`CMakeLists.txt:195-196`），所以傳輸層自己也沒有輔助執行緒。任一瞬間的條數就是：一，加上開著的工作階段，再加上那些已經被放生、還在跑的計算。"

#: ../../architecture.md:117 ae7f110b329642f7bbcce13ca3fe2136
msgid "**\"Worker\" names two things and only one of them is a thread.** The class (`session/worker.*`) is one thread owning one session for the session's whole life. The supervisor's `workerId` is a *process* — a placement and a set of seats — and owns no thread at all; a shared worker holding eight sessions is eight `Worker` objects and eight threads. `Supervisor::killWorker` addresses the process-shaped thing and `Worker::requestStop` the thread, and both appear in the same call path."
msgstr "**「工作者」指的是兩件事，而其中只有一件是執行緒。** 那個類別（`session/worker.*`）是一條執行緒擁有一個工作階段，直到該工作階段結束為止。監督者口中的 `workerId` 則是一個*行程*——一種安置方式加上一組座位——它自己完全不擁有執行緒；一個裝了八個工作階段的共用工作者，就是八個 `Worker` 物件、八條執行緒。`Supervisor::killWorker` 對付的是那個行程形狀的東西，`Worker::requestStop` 對付的是執行緒，而兩者出現在同一條呼叫路徑上。"

#: ../../architecture.md:125 f69d9d28a14c4f7ba3e2a147157564dd
msgid "**Nothing bounds the thread count against the size of the machine.** `acquireSeat` takes the first shared worker with room and starts another whenever none has any (`supervisor.cpp:93-112`), nothing caps how many workers there may be, and the supervisor holds no queue of sessions waiting for a seat. The ninth concurrent session therefore gets a ninth thread rather than a queue slot, and the only ceiling is the gateway's: `maxConnections` × `maxSessionsPerConnection`, 32 × 16 by default, so 512 session threads — a figure chosen for socket safety rather than for cores. `sessionsPerSharedWorker` bounds what one kill would take down with it, not how much runs at once; the pooled shape in §2.1, where that knob is sized against cores and the excess queues, is the intent rather than the behaviour."
msgstr "**沒有任何東西讓執行緒的數量對齊機器的大小。** `acquireSeat` 取第一個還有空位的共用工作者，一個有空位的都沒有時就再開一個（`supervisor.cpp:93-112`），工作者能開幾個沒有上限，監督者也沒有一個「等座位的工作階段」佇列。所以第九個並行的工作階段拿到的是第九條執行緒，而不是一個排隊位置；唯一的天花板是閘道的：`maxConnections` × `maxSessionsPerConnection`，預設 32 × 16，也就是 512 條工作階段執行緒——這個數字是為了通訊端的安全而定，不是為了核心數。`sessionsPerSharedWorker` 限制的是一次 kill 會連帶帶走多少東西，不是同時跑多少；§2.1 裡那個把旋鈕對著核心數調、多出來的就排隊的池化形狀，是意圖而不是行為。"

#: ../../architecture.md:138 3f23e5b0987b419fb67f05f16581a57b
msgid "**Parallelism is across sessions and nowhere else.** Two sessions price at the same time on two threads with nothing between them: `session.cpp` holds no mutex, because every QuantLib singleton is `thread_local` and each session has its own `Settings`, evaluation date and `IndexManager`. Within one session the worker serves its queue one frame at a time, and a single price never uses more than one core — QuantLib has no thread pool of its own and its four OpenMP pragmas are off here (§2.2). Two sessions on a multi-core machine is a real 2×; one session is never more than 1×."
msgstr "**並行只發生在工作階段之間，別無他處。** 兩個工作階段可以在兩條執行緒上同時定價，中間什麼都不隔：`session.cpp` 裡沒有任何互斥鎖，因為 QuantLib 的每個單例都是 `thread_local`，每個工作階段都有自己的 `Settings`、評價日與 `IndexManager`。在一個工作階段之內，工作者一次只服務佇列裡的一個訊框；而單一次定價從來不會用到一個以上的核心——QuantLib 自己沒有執行緒池，它那四個 OpenMP pragma 在這裡是關掉的（§2.2）。在多核機器上，兩個工作階段是實打實的兩倍；一個工作階段永遠不會超過一倍。"

#: ../../architecture.md:147 e9306fd59a994ed4a1a2ecd00ca99c7e
msgid "**Moving a session between seats is a close and a replay.** `placementFor` keys on the engine: Monte Carlo and finite difference take a sacrificial seat, everything else a shared one (`supervisor.cpp:190-208`), and a batch inherits the placement of the longest thing in it. When that disagrees with where the session is sitting, the supervisor closes it on the old seat, takes a new one, and replays the `SessionLog` into it (`supervisor.cpp:247-263`); the next analytic price brings it back. The graph is thread-bound and cannot be handed over, so each move costs a fresh bootstrap."
msgstr "**把工作階段在座位之間搬動，是一次關閉加一次重播。** `placementFor` 看的是引擎：蒙地卡羅與有限差分去可犧牲的座位，其餘的去共用座位（`supervisor.cpp:190-208`），而一個批次會繼承它裡面最長那件工作的安置。當這個結果和工作階段目前坐的地方不一致，監督者就在舊座位上把它關掉、取一個新座位，再把 `SessionLog` 重播進去（`supervisor.cpp:247-263`）；下一次解析定價又會把它帶回來。物件圖綁在執行緒上、無法交接，所以每搬一次就要付一次重新啟動的代價。"

#: ../../architecture.md:156 56f684e0b6964141bfb1db3cf15cb73c
msgid "**A kill is a disown.** `ThreadProcessHost::kill` asks the worker to stop, sets its `alive` flag false so every frame it emits afterwards is dropped on the loop, and hands the seat to a detached reaper (`threadhost.cpp:102-116`). The calculation runs to completion and keeps its core the whole time; the supervisor has already answered `CANCELLED` and replayed the session elsewhere, so the seat comes back when the work ends rather than when the user asks for it. Three shapes stop for real, and they are the three with an outer loop this service wrote rather than an engine call it cannot reach into: a batched Monte Carlo between batches (`session.cpp:2903`), a sweep between points (`worker.cpp:341`), and a book between trades (`worker.cpp:458`)."
msgstr "**kill 其實是斷絕關係。** `ThreadProcessHost::kill` 會請工作者停下來，把它的 `alive` 旗標設成 false，讓它之後送出的每一個訊框都在迴圈上被丟掉，再把座位交給一條 detached 的回收執行緒（`threadhost.cpp:102-116`）。那個計算會一路跑完，而且全程佔著一顆核心；監督者早就回了 `CANCELLED` 並把工作階段重播到別處，所以座位是在工作結束時才回來，不是在使用者要求時。真正停得下來的有三種形狀，就是那三種外層迴圈由這個服務自己寫、而不是它伸不進去的引擎呼叫：分批的蒙地卡羅在批次之間（`session.cpp:2903`）、掃描在點與點之間（`worker.cpp:341`），以及一本部位在交易與交易之間（`worker.cpp:458`）。"

#: ../../architecture.md:167 0306477f1a904908a38a847a9f2f6ed7
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**One process is one blast radius.** Every session graph, every `SessionLog` and the gateway's connection state share an address space and a heap. `Worker::serve` catches `FieldError`, `QuantLib::Error` and `std::exception` (`worker.cpp:624-651`), so a rejected trade or a failed bootstrap is answered on the wire and costs its session nothing; a segfault, or anything that reaches `std::terminate`, takes every other session on the box with it. {doc}`limits` states that from the outside. The seam that would end it is already the only one that has to change: `Supervisor::ProcessHost`, which decides no policy and which the supervisor's tests already substitute."
msgstr "**一個行程就是一個波及範圍。** 每一份工作階段的物件圖、每一份 `SessionLog`，以及閘道的連線狀態，共用同一個位址空間與同一個堆積。`Worker::serve` 會接住 `FieldError`、`QuantLib::Error` 與 `std::exception`（`worker.cpp:624-651`），所以一筆被拒絕的交易或一次失敗的啟動只會在線上被回答，對它的工作階段毫無代價；但一次 segfault，或任何走到 `std::terminate` 的東西，會把這台機器上其他每一個工作階段一起帶走。{doc}`limits` 從外面說明了這件事。而要終結它的接縫，已經是唯一需要改的那一個：`Supervisor::ProcessHost`，它不決定任何政策，監督者的測試也早就用替身把它換掉了。"

