#: ../../architecture.md:191 3c23ebcde4644edd823805a9f88c5a8d
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**The document is the workbook**, and it is the only state that survives everything on this side: market objects, the trade, the book and the panel state, saved to one `localStorage` key as canonical Protobuf JSON by `store/workbookCodec.ts`. {doc}`interface` sets out the split from a user's point of view; the developer's version of it is that `workbookSlice` is the input to a replay, so anything that must survive a restart of the service has to live there and nowhere else."
msgstr "**那份文件就是工作簿**，也是這一邊唯一撐得過一切的狀態：市場物件、交易、交易簿與面板狀態，由 `store/workbookCodec.ts` 以標準 Protobuf JSON 存進單一個 `localStorage` 鍵。{doc}`interface` 從使用者的角度講這個切分；開發者版本的說法是：`workbookSlice` 是重播的輸入，所以任何必須撐過服務重啟的東西，都得住在那裡，別無他處。"

#: ../../architecture.md:199 63e329dbbe4f40898e335d217debe563
msgid "**Structural against live is a counter, not a guess.** `workbook.structureRevision` counts edits that change the shape of the graph. The session records the revision it was opened at, and the two disagreeing is what puts the amber rebuild bar on the market pane. `UpdateMarket` carries quotes and nothing else, so this is the whole of the distinction."
msgstr "**結構性與即時性的差別是一個計數器，不是猜測。** `workbook.structureRevision` 數的是會改變物件圖形狀的編輯。工作階段記下自己是在哪一版開的，兩者不一致就是市場面板上那條琥珀色重建列出現的原因。`UpdateMarket` 只帶報價、別的都不帶，所以這就是這個區分的全部。"

#: ../../architecture.md:205 6a81009377f848c7be4003d14d5587ae
msgid "**The gates are a second copy of a fact the service owns**, which is exactly why they are checked rather than trusted. `capabilities.ts` says what this build offers; the service answers `Hello` with what it dispatches; `drift.ts` diffs the two and `drift.integration.test.ts` fails on any disagreement. Only the *sets* are compared — that an analytic barrier is European only is a combination rule, and combination rules stay local."
msgstr "**閘門是服務所擁有的事實的第二份副本**，正因如此它們是被檢查、而不是被信任的。`capabilities.ts` 說這個版本提供什麼；服務用 `Hello` 的回覆說它派工什麼；`drift.ts` 比對兩者，而 `drift.integration.test.ts` 只要有任何不一致就失敗。只比對*集合*——解析解障礙選擇權只吃歐式，這是組合規則，而組合規則留在本地。"

#: ../../architecture.md:212 302116e667e145cc848dd6a08f19d1db
msgid "**Transport scheduling is not in the store.** `session/repricer.ts` keeps at most one write-and-price in flight and holds the latest slider value in module state, because a drag emits far more values than the service can price and each is superseded by the next. Putting that in Redux would make every pixel an action with no reader."
msgstr "**傳輸排程不放在 store 裡。** `session/repricer.ts` 讓在途的「寫入加定價」最多只有一筆，並把最新的滑桿值放在模組狀態裡，因為一次拖曳送出的值遠多於服務定得完的量，而每一個都被下一個取代。把這件事放進 Redux，只會讓每一個像素都變成一個沒有讀者的 action。"

#: ../../architecture.md:218 0abcf6c8a30a4af3b6dbba2c9299e145
msgid "One price, end to end"
msgstr "每個存活的工作階段一條"

#: ../../architecture.md:220 fb748579a1ef48028bbf5db32ec674b8
msgid "A quote drag is the shortest path through both halves, and it touches every layer above."
msgstr "拖一次報價是穿過兩邊最短的路徑，而它碰到上面每一層。"

#: ../../architecture.md:223 40205d41e3dc4f5fafbb6128f5aa5d5c
msgid "The slider dispatches `bumpQuote`. The workbook takes the value at once — the control must not lag the finger — and the latest value is queued for the wire (`session/repricer.ts`)."
msgstr "滑桿送出 `bumpQuote`。工作簿立刻收下那個值——控制項不能落後手指——而最新的值排隊等著上線（`session/repricer.ts`）。"

#: ../../architecture.md:226 b537bd3d2ebd4fd397a806066639d2a3
msgid "`writeQuotes` sends one `UpdateMarket` with the pending writes, then `priceCurrentTrade` sends a `Price` carrying `workbook.trade`. Both go through `WireClient.send`, which allocates the `request_id` and registers the promise that the terminal frame will settle."
msgstr "`writeQuotes` 送出一個帶著待寫值的 `UpdateMarket`，接著 `priceCurrentTrade` 送出一個帶著 `workbook.trade` 的 `Price`。兩者都經過 `WireClient.send`，由它配發 `request_id`，並登記那個會被終結訊框敲定的 promise。"

#: ../../architecture.md:230 da36c64e22cc4a94959ad4bbb592fd50
msgid "The gateway reads the frame, checks the session, and hands it to that session's worker queue."
msgstr "閘道讀到訊框，檢查工作階段，然後把它交給該工作階段的工作者佇列。"

#: ../../architecture.md:232 47d70c3589ff4db18a2b441c96c62dfe
msgid "The worker takes it on its own thread. `UpdateMarket` writes the quotes behind an `UpdateGuard`, so the observer graph fires once rather than once per quote; `Price` builds the instrument from payoff × exercise × underlying × style, chooses the engine, and calls `NPV()`. Only what depends on the moved quote recomputes: nothing is rebuilt."
msgstr "工作者在自己的執行緒上接手。`UpdateMarket` 在一個 `UpdateGuard` 之下寫入報價，所以觀察者圖只觸發一次，而不是每個報價各一次；`Price` 以收益函數 × 履約方式 × 標的 × 類型建出商品，選好引擎，然後呼叫 `NPV()`。只有依賴那個被移動的報價的部分會重算：沒有任何東西被重建。"

#: ../../architecture.md:237 f7bdc4574d85411cb714e396bc3da0e4
msgid "The `Ack` is folded into the session log — and only on the `Ack`, which is what keeps the log a description of what the worker actually holds — and the `PriceResult` goes back with the NPV, the requested result kinds, the ones that were not available, and the engine echoed as it ran."
msgstr "`Ack` 會被摺進工作階段紀錄——而且只有在 `Ack` 時才會，這正是讓那份紀錄始終是「工作者實際持有什麼」的描述的原因——而 `PriceResult` 帶著淨現值、你要的結果種類、沒能提供的那些，以及照實回聲的引擎設定回來。"

#: ../../architecture.md:241 3b805af9a692457e8389ca373bb817c3
msgid "`middleware.ts` mirrors both frames into the store; the result pane renders from state, and the repricer sends whatever arrived while it was waiting."
msgstr "`middleware.ts` 把兩個方向的訊框都鏡射進 store；結果欄從狀態算出畫面，而重定價器把等待期間送到的值再送出去。"

#: ../../architecture.md:244 a05e7d9528a44bdcb6ffb744c7a91a1d
msgid "A structural edit is the other path, and it is deliberately longer: validate, topologically sort the market so the user never has to order it by hand, close the old session, open a new one, and price again."
msgstr "結構性編輯是另一條路徑，而且刻意比較長：驗證、把市場拓撲排序好讓使用者永遠不必自己排、關掉舊的工作階段、開一個新的，然後重新定價。"

